  "truncated": false,
  "retweet_count": "20",
  "id": "1490786374248812549",
  "created_at": "Mon Feb 07 20:35:43 +0000 2022",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "ENS aims to be both a decentralized domain and identity system and as such needs to be built to be censorship resistant and neutral. But to get there it needs an including community of builders in which all are welcome.\n\nThat path is neither easy nor without its own conflicts.",
  "lang": "en"
 },
 {
  "edit_info": {
   "initial": {
    "editTweetIds": [
     "1490786376090062851"
    ],
    "editableUntil": "2022-02-07T21:35:44.188Z",
    "editsRemaining": "5",
    "isEditEligible": true
   }
  },
  "retweeted": false,
  "source": "<a href=\"http://twitter.com/#!/download/ipad\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter for iPad</a>",
  "entities": {
   "hashtags": [],
   "symbols": [],
   "user_mentions": [],
   "urls": []
  },
  "display_text_range": [
   "0",
   "269"
  ],
  "favorite_count": "33",
  "in_reply_to_status_id_str": "1490786374248812549",
  "id_str": "1490786376090062851",
  "in_reply_to_user_id": "10157",
  "truncated": false,
  "retweet_count": "0",
  "id": "1490786376090062851",
  "in_reply_to_status_id": "1490786374248812549",
  "created_at": "Mon Feb 07 20:35:44 +0000 2022",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "Long before Brantly joined ENS, there had been multiple other contributors, many of them queer, at least two were Trans. I only knew that the same way I found out about Brantly’s own deeply held beliefs: casual conversations over dinner in conferences around the world.",
  "lang": "en",
  "in_reply_to_screen_name": "avsa",
  "in_reply_to_user_id_str": "10157"
 },
 {
  "edit_info": {
   "initial": {
    "editTweetIds": [
     "1490786377260314628"
    ],
    "editableUntil": "2022-02-07T21:35:44.467Z",
    "editsRemaining": "5",
    "isEditEligible": true
   }
  },
  "retweeted": false,
  "source": "<a href=\"http://twitter.com/#!/download/ipad\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter for iPad</a>",
  "entities": {
   "hashtags": [],
   "symbols": [],
   "user_mentions": [],
   "urls": []
  },
  "display_text_range": [
   "0",
   "278"
  ],
  "favorite_count": "42",
  "in_reply_to_status_id_str": "1490786376090062851",
  "id_str": "1490786377260314628",
  "in_reply_to_user_id": "10157",
  "truncated": false,
  "retweet_count": "2",
  "id": "1490786377260314628",
  "in_reply_to_status_id": "1490786376090062851",
  "created_at": "Mon Feb 07 20:35:44 +0000 2022",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "As it should be: people’s work only judged by their own merit, independent of the contributors religion, skin tone, gender or country of origin. I think the acceptance of anonymity and respect for privacy in the industry creates an environment where people can be who they want.",
  "lang": "en",
  "in_reply_to_screen_name": "avsa",
  "in_reply_to_user_id_str": "10157"
 },
 {
  "edit_info": {
   "initial": {
    "editTweetIds": [
     "1490786379500068868"
    ],
    "editableUntil": "2022-02-07T21:35:45.001Z",
    "editsRemaining": "5",
    "isEditEligible": true
   }
  },
  "retweeted": false,
  "source": "<a href=\"http://twitter.com/#!/download/ipad\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter for iPad</a>",
  "entities": {
   "hashtags": [],
   "symbols": [],
   "user_mentions": [],
   "urls": []
  },
  "display_text_range": [
   "0",
   "280"
  ],
  "favorite_count": "34",
  "in_reply_to_status_id_str": "1490786377260314628",
  "id_str": "1490786379500068868",
  "in_reply_to_user_id": "10157",
  "truncated": false,
  "retweet_count": "0",
  "id": "1490786379500068868",
  "in_reply_to_status_id": "1490786377260314628",
  "created_at": "Mon Feb 07 20:35:45 +0000 2022",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "I’ve known Brantly for years (he worked with me in Unilogin in 2018) and I’ve seen him do great work. I’ve reached to some of these other contributors and I did not hear a single instance where people felt they were treated differently by him. But he wasn’t just a dev hidden away",
  "lang": "en",
  "in_reply_to_screen_name": "avsa",
  "in_reply_to_user_id_str": "10157"
 },
 {
  "edit_info": {
   "initial": {
    "editTweetIds": [
     "1490786380854796294"
    ],
    "editableUntil": "2022-02-07T21:35:45.324Z",
    "editsRemaining": "5",
    "isEditEligible": true
   }
  },
  "retweeted": false,
  "source": "<a href=\"http://twitter.com/#!/download/ipad\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter for iPad</a>",
  "entities": {
   "hashtags": [],
   "symbols": [],
   "user_mentions": [],
   "urls": []
  },
  "display_text_range": [
   "0",
   "279"
  ],
  "favorite_count": "32",
  "in_reply_to_status_id_str": "1490786379500068868",
  "id_str": "1490786380854796294",
  "in_reply_to_user_id": "10157",
  "truncated": false,
  "retweet_count": "0",
  "id": "1490786380854796294",
  "in_reply_to_status_id": "1490786379500068868",
  "created_at": "Mon Feb 07 20:35:45 +0000 2022",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "Brantly was the de facto spokesperson for the project, the ones that journalists would reach out to hear a word, and maybe the project wouldn’t be where it is today without him. I admired his grit.\n\nIt’s hard to be the spokesperson of a community that doesn’t feel spoken by you.",
  "lang": "en",
  "in_reply_to_screen_name": "avsa",
  "in_reply_to_user_id_str": "10157"
 },
 {
  "edit_info": {
   "initial": {
    "editTweetIds": [
     "1490786382087864320"
    ],
    "editableUntil": "2022-02-07T21:35:45.618Z",
    "editsRemaining": "5",
    "isEditEligible": true
   }
  },
  "retweeted": false,
  "source": "<a href=\"http://twitter.com/#!/download/ipad\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter for iPad</a>",
  "entities": {
   "hashtags": [],
   "symbols": [],
   "user_mentions": [],
   "urls": []
  },
  "display_text_range": [
   "0",
   "266"
  ],
  "favorite_count": "68",
  "in_reply_to_status_id_str": "1490786380854796294",
  "id_str": "1490786382087864320",
  "in_reply_to_user_id": "10157",
  "truncated": false,
  "retweet_count": "1",
  "id": "1490786382087864320",
  "in_reply_to_status_id": "1490786380854796294",
  "created_at": "Mon Feb 07 20:35:45 +0000 2022",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "I would like to find a way for Brantly to still be a part of ENS, in a position where he didn’t needed to represent a community that didn’t share his values. Maybe there’s still a space for this, but I feel the rushed termination process might have been too drastic.",
  "lang": "en",
  "in_reply_to_screen_name": "avsa",
  "in_reply_to_user_id_str": "10157"
 },
 {
  "edit_info": {
   "initial": {
    "editTweetIds": [
     "1490786383350444037"
    ],
    "editableUntil": "2022-02-07T21:35:45.919Z",
    "editsRemaining": "5",
    "isEditEligible": true
   }
  },
  "retweeted": false,
  "source": "<a href=\"http://twitter.com/#!/download/ipad\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter for iPad</a>",
  "entities": {
   "hashtags": [],
   "symbols": [],
   "user_mentions": [],
   "urls": []
  },
  "display_text_range": [
   "0",
   "247"
  ],
  "favorite_count": "52",
  "in_reply_to_status_id_str": "1490786382087864320",
  "id_str": "1490786383350444037",
  "in_reply_to_user_id": "10157",
  "truncated": false,
  "retweet_count": "4",
  "id": "1490786383350444037",
  "in_reply_to_status_id": "1490786382087864320",
  "created_at": "Mon Feb 07 20:35:45 +0000 2022",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "This whole debate has raised a much more important question about decentralization and governance. What happens to your names if ENS is taken over by people who don’t share your values? What are the failures of our own governance that led to this?",
  "lang": "en",
  "in_reply_to_screen_name": "avsa",
  "in_reply_to_user_id_str": "10157"
 },
 {
  "edit_info": {
   "initial": {
    "editTweetIds": [
     "1490787675854491652"
    ],
    "editableUntil": "2022-02-07T21:40:54.076Z",
    "editsRemaining": "5",
    "isEditEligible": true
   }
  },
  "retweeted": false,
  "source": "<a href=\"http://twitter.com/#!/download/ipad\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter for iPad</a>",
  "entities": {
   "hashtags": [],
   "symbols": [],
   "user_mentions": [],
   "urls": []
  },
  "display_text_range": [
   "0",
   "260"
  ],
  "favorite_count": "44",
  "in_reply_to_status_id_str": "1490786383350444037",
  "id_str": "1490787675854491652",
  "in_reply_to_user_id": "10157",
  "truncated": false,
  "retweet_count": "1",
  "id": "1490787675854491652",
  "in_reply_to_status_id": "1490786383350444037",
  "created_at": "Mon Feb 07 20:40:54 +0000 2022",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "Brantly was terminated from True Names, as is the right of their directors as a private entity?\n\nBut why does a DAO depends so much on a single Singaporean entity?\n\nI believe it should not, and it would benefit for the community to be more legally distributed.",
  "lang": "en",
  "in_reply_to_screen_name": "avsa",
  "in_reply_to_user_id_str": "10157"
 },
 {
  "edit_info": {
   "initial": {
    "editTweetIds": [
     "1490787677272223746"
    ],
    "editableUntil": "2022-02-07T21:40:54.414Z",
    "editsRemaining": "5",
    "isEditEligible": true
   }
  },
  "retweeted": false,
  "source": "<a href=\"http://twitter.com/#!/download/ipad\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter for iPad</a>",
  "entities": {
   "hashtags": [],
   "symbols": [],
   "user_mentions": [],
   "urls": []
  },
  "display_text_range": [
   "0",
   "274"
  ],
  "favorite_count": "41",
  "in_reply_to_status_id_str": "1490787675854491652",
  "id_str": "1490787677272223746",
  "in_reply_to_user_id": "10157",
  "truncated": false,
  "retweet_count": "1",
  "id": "1490787677272223746",
  "in_reply_to_status_id": "1490787675854491652",
  "created_at": "Mon Feb 07 20:40:54 +0000 2022",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "In the beginning of the year I was invited by Brantly to join the core team. It felt wrong then and it feels wronger now:\n\nGoing forward I intend that my ENS contributions will be made as a separate entity, with a different jurisdiction, that does not rely on ENS core team.",
  "lang": "en",
  "in_reply_to_screen_name": "avsa",
  "in_reply_to_user_id_str": "10157"
 },
 {
  "edit_info": {
   "initial": {
    "editTweetIds": [
     "1490789447528595457"
    ],
    "editableUntil": "2022-02-07T21:47:56.476Z",
    "editsRemaining": "5",
    "isEditEligible": true
   }
  },
  "retweeted": false,
  "source": "<a href=\"http://twitter.com/#!/download/ipad\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter for iPad</a>",
  "entities": {
   "hashtags": [],
   "symbols": [],
   "user_mentions": [],
