   "272"
  ],
  "favorite_count": "23",
  "in_reply_to_status_id_str": "1490789451563511823",
  "id_str": "1490791984709226498",
  "in_reply_to_user_id": "10157",
  "truncated": false,
  "retweet_count": "0",
  "id": "1490791984709226498",
  "in_reply_to_status_id": "1490789451563511823",
  "created_at": "Mon Feb 07 20:58:01 +0000 2022",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "Thirdly: Brantly is a director of the ENS foundation, a non profit incorporated in the Cayman Islands. I’m sure there are good tax reasons for it to exist, but it also creates another bottleneck for the DAO.\n\nWe could have a more public debate on the roles of that entity.",
  "lang": "en",
  "in_reply_to_screen_name": "avsa",
  "in_reply_to_user_id_str": "10157"
 },
 {
  "edit_info": {
   "initial": {
    "editTweetIds": [
     "1490791986672119816"
    ],
    "editableUntil": "2022-02-07T21:58:01.855Z",
    "editsRemaining": "5",
    "isEditEligible": true
   }
  },
  "retweeted": false,
  "source": "<a href=\"http://twitter.com/#!/download/ipad\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter for iPad</a>",
  "entities": {
   "hashtags": [],
   "symbols": [],
   "user_mentions": [],
   "urls": []
  },
  "display_text_range": [
   "0",
   "237"
  ],
  "favorite_count": "21",
  "in_reply_to_status_id_str": "1490791984709226498",
  "id_str": "1490791986672119816",
  "in_reply_to_user_id": "10157",
  "truncated": false,
  "retweet_count": "0",
  "id": "1490791986672119816",
  "in_reply_to_status_id": "1490791984709226498",
  "created_at": "Mon Feb 07 20:58:01 +0000 2022",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "Four: what are the roles of the DAO in .eth names? What can be done to domains if top delegation is taken over by people who don’t share your values?\n\nNot much really. But some could, and we need to investigate and consider alternatives.",
  "lang": "en",
  "in_reply_to_screen_name": "avsa",
  "in_reply_to_user_id_str": "10157"
 },
 {
  "edit_info": {
   "initial": {
    "editTweetIds": [
     "1490791988853157889"
    ],
    "editableUntil": "2022-02-07T21:58:02.375Z",
    "editsRemaining": "5",
    "isEditEligible": true
   }
  },
  "retweeted": false,
  "source": "<a href=\"http://twitter.com/#!/download/ipad\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter for iPad</a>",
  "entities": {
   "hashtags": [],
   "symbols": [],
   "user_mentions": [],
   "urls": []
  },
  "display_text_range": [
   "0",
   "227"
  ],
  "favorite_count": "20",
  "in_reply_to_status_id_str": "1490791986672119816",
  "id_str": "1490791988853157889",
  "in_reply_to_user_id": "10157",
  "truncated": false,
  "retweet_count": "0",
  "id": "1490791988853157889",
  "in_reply_to_status_id": "1490791986672119816",
  "created_at": "Mon Feb 07 20:58:02 +0000 2022",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "The .eth registrar is still under the control of the multisig, but we can expect it to be transferred to the DAO anytime. When it’s done we need to make sure that it maintains it’s locked state and maybe even lock it even more.",
  "lang": "en",
  "in_reply_to_screen_name": "avsa",
  "in_reply_to_user_id_str": "10157"
 },
 {
  "edit_info": {
   "initial": {
    "editTweetIds": [
     "1490791990988054533"
    ],
    "editableUntil": "2022-02-07T21:58:02.884Z",
    "editsRemaining": "5",
    "isEditEligible": true
   }
  },
  "retweeted": false,
  "source": "<a href=\"http://twitter.com/#!/download/ipad\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter for iPad</a>",
  "entities": {
   "hashtags": [],
   "symbols": [],
   "user_mentions": [],
   "urls": []
  },
  "display_text_range": [
   "0",
   "271"
  ],
  "favorite_count": "22",
  "in_reply_to_status_id_str": "1490791988853157889",
  "id_str": "1490791990988054533",
  "in_reply_to_user_id": "10157",
  "truncated": false,
  "retweet_count": "0",
  "id": "1490791990988054533",
  "in_reply_to_status_id": "1490791988853157889",
  "created_at": "Mon Feb 07 20:58:02 +0000 2022",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "As it currently stands, the .eth registrar cannot take away any name that is registered, but it can change the rules on how renewals and new registrations happen. There are good reasons not to freeze that right now but we should try to see how we can limit those further.",
  "lang": "en",
  "in_reply_to_screen_name": "avsa",
  "in_reply_to_user_id_str": "10157"
 },
